              <span>Official GPT subscription</span>
              <h1>正版官方 GPT 订阅，开通到你的账号</h1>
              <p>
                为你的 ChatGPT 官方账号开通正版 Plus / Pro 套餐权益，支持使用 GPT 与 Codex 等官方能力。
                下单前先识别真实登录账号，确保订阅开通到客户本人账号。
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="new-theme-official-hero-badge">
              <Sparkles :size="18" />
              <span>Plus / Pro 5x / Pro 10x / Pro 25x</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <div class="new-theme-official-plans">
            <article
              v-for="plan in officialSubscriptionPlans"
              :key="plan.id"
              :class="['new-theme-official-plan-card', `tone-${plan.tone}`, { featured: plan.featured }]"
            >
              <div class="new-theme-official-plan-top">
                <span>{{ plan.badge }}</span>
                <strong>{{ plan.name }}</strong>
                <small>{{ plan.tagline }}</small>
              </div>
              <p>{{ plan.description }}</p>
              <div class="new-theme-official-plan-list">
                <span v-for="highlight in plan.highlights" :key="highlight">
                  <CheckCircle2 :size="14" />
